WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.749
All my cars have

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.649
good stereos.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:21.650
I mean, loud stereos.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.039
You've got to feel the music.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.159
Hey, do some hopping.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.478
A 30 year ban

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:47.259
on cruising in

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.149
National City is over.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.009
In just two weeks, many men

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:52.539
and women are planning to join the

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.549
low and slow crews in the streets

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:56.408
of National City.

00:00:56.409 --> 00:00:57.409
How's it going?

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:01.360
My name is Vincent Palacios.

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:03.849
I grew up in Paradise Hills and

00:01:03.850 --> 00:01:05.620
moved here in 1976.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.240
I have a low rider shop, doesn't

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.039
take care of all the bills, but it's

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.839
an enjoyment to see people drive

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.969
away like they got a new toy

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:16.970
on Christmas.

00:01:21.490 --> 00:01:23.649
All my kids have all

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:25.359
cruised with me.

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.189
My youngest son helps

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.049
me at the shop and is

00:01:29.050 --> 00:01:30.999
like really involved in

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.169
the little writing community.

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:33.129
This one doesn't hop.

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:34.149
I mean, I can play with it, but it

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:35.839
doesn't hop. Not meant for hopping.

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:36.840
Yeah.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.076
She's never been in a low rider in

00:01:44.077 --> 00:01:44.879
her life.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:46.109
Oh, my god.

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.211
Now she's going to get stuck.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:52.879
You're going to see a bunch of other

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:53.880
cars like this, so go there. Uh,

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:55.999
y'all know the address?

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.829
I can type it in my phone? I think

00:01:57.830 --> 00:01:59.389
if you look up Chicano Park, it

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.390
should. Okay.

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:02.780
Chicano Park.

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.069
We'll see you guys tomorrow in
Chicano Park.

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.079
Yeah, bring, bring, bring this girl.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.080
All right.

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:16.531
Back in '82,

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.419
the low riding, yeah, it was

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:21.479
a lot more fun.

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:32.129
This whole area right

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:34.019
here on your right would just get

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.909
packed with people, all

00:02:35.910 --> 00:02:37.169
the low riders would park in this

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.269
parking lot, and it would

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.470
get crazy over here.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.409
So low riding was really born,

00:02:44.410 --> 00:02:45.939
you know, after World War II.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:48.099
And there was a sort of rise in

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.139
car culture activities and

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:52.389
cruising and demolition derbies

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.949
and custom culture.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.959
Chicanos have definitely been

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.389
key in popularizing low riding.

00:02:58.390 --> 00:03:00.189
But I think you begin to see in the

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.079
nineties, particularly here in

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.939
L.A., like anti cruising

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.799
ordinances, cracking down

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.869
right on cruising, cracking

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:10.029
down on if a certain amount

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:12.099
of black men or brown men would be

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:13.359
hanging out in the street.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.009
We call those gang injunctions,

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.489
which they could be gang members or

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:17.728
could just be a group of friends or

00:03:17.729 --> 00:03:18.969
a club hanging out.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.499
The police could use that to sort of

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.459
crack down.

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:22.719
So that's when you sort of see those

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:24.699
cruising ordinances really being put

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:25.720
into effect here.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:30.249
It wasn't until like the nineties

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.379
the police started

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:33.819
harassing us.

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:35.799
They put signs up on Highland

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.689
Avenue and said

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.529
that cruising is prohibited

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.599
and they would actually measure

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:45.219
with a cigarette  pack.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.659
If it was lower than a cigarette

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.609
pack, then you were

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.079
illegal.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.419
Why pick on one style

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:54.309
of car or one

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.310
race?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:57.549
It's unfair.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.550
Big time.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.399
I've grown up seeing the no cruising

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.949
ban and always wondering

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:08.159
why really was it banned and

00:04:08.160 --> 00:04:10.079
why my dad's generation

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.029
of low riding wasn't able to express

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.030
themselves anymore.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.189
I think one of the reasons about

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.749
like cruising is that it's sort of

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.309
slowing down traffic.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.899
Just even during the pandemic, it

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.679
got shut down.

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:25.509
People that come and do the donuts

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:27.399
and motorcycles and then it became

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.779
this public nuisance.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.189
Right. And so I think it's always a

00:04:30.190 --> 00:04:31.190
tension.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.239
I couldn't even tell you the age of

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.769
when I started going cruising.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.539
It's been all my life.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.489
It goes from

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:41.959
cruising with your dad and in the

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:44.239
back seat with your parents

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.930
to building model car kits.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.559
This weekend is Chicano Park Day

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:53.479
coming up this Saturday, one

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.609
of the biggest events in San Diego

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:56.869
and the lowrider community.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.569
After three years of either no

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:03.029
celebrations or a virtual one,

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.229
Chicano Park Day is back in full

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.230
force.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.479
The ban on Highland,

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.489
it made Chicano Park even more

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.689
popular because

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:15.299
you know nobody wanted to go down

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:17.189
Highland because of the cops.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.119
Straighten out, straighten out,

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.120
straighten out.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.879
Okay, now straight.

00:05:23.480 --> 00:05:24.949
Hey, did we get a good spot or what?

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.019
Chicano Park, that was the people's

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:31.829
park.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.411
So cruising on Chicano Park,

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:35.749
that never stopped.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.139
Chicano Park Day is really to

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.819
commemorate the fight all those

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.679
years ago, back in the seventies

00:05:40.680 --> 00:05:42.059
to keep this park here.

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.289
If this park wasn't here, you want

00:05:43.290 --> 00:05:44.669
to be able to show off your car or

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.639
your Chicano culture.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:46.859
Tell me about that.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:47.879
Oh, yeah.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.439
This was kind of the epicenter in

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:51.419
San Diego for low riding.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.309
So we enjoy coming out

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.229
here and, you know, we don't get

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.369
harassed or nothing.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.719
It's beautiful out here.

00:05:57.720 --> 00:05:58.799
Yeah. Awesome.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:05:59.909
Thank you so much.

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:00.921
Good luck today. Okay.

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.369
I've only been going since

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:07.749
the late eighties.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:10.089
I can tell you for sure,

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.919
because of the community it's

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.289
in, that community has really

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.290
evolved.

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.549
Today I think

00:06:18.550 --> 00:06:20.619
what is different with cruising is

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:22.359
that lowriders are trying to work

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.249
with their local cities to sort

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.559
of end the anti cruising ordinances,

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.059
like they've been successful in

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:30.339
Sacramento, in San Jose,

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:32.289
and also in National City just

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:34.239
recently, which is out there by San

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.109
Diego.

00:06:35.110 --> 00:06:37.269
But there's still a California

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:39.189
anti cruising ordinance that's

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.329
in existence.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.979
So the work right now is to sort of

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.079
end the anti cruising ordinance

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.479
in California and then for local

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:48.549
cities to find a way

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.289
for lowriders to work with law

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.179
enforcement to have sort of

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:54.159
a cruising space

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.109
that is not a public nuisance.

