Rabbit, I've known probably

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.290
20, 30 years plus.

00:07:06.340 --> 00:07:08.199
He used to be in a car club called

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.189
Amigos.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:11.019
And then Jovita, she's more

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:13.479
of the person to talk to you about

00:07:13.480 --> 00:07:15.429
the rebuild and National City.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:21.499
How is Chicano Park?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.539
Oh, crazy, crazy, crazy.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:24.349
I mean.

00:07:24.350 --> 00:07:25.609
Well, everybody's been craving it

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.349
for four years because of COVID.

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:29.029
It was even harder to walk down the

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:30.320
aisles and look at cars.

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.469
Mr. Rabbit.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.669
Vincent.

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:37.259
You know, this one's a hard one to

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:37.769
get, right?

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:38.999
Yes, it is.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.409
Especially after the mayor took them

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:41.609
all down. You know, people were

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.319
stealing 'em. Yeah.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.179
They invite everybody over there,

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:47.489
and it becomes like a community

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.809
really fast.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:50.789
Literally, we had papers

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:53.249
and questions, and we wrote down I

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.169
think number one was,

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:56.969
do we bring crime?

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.859
Do we cause

00:07:58.860 --> 00:08:00.029
problems?

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:02.160
That's what we're trying to address.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:04.690
So that

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.209
when we do go to like a community

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:10.219
event, that doesn't

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.359
happen no more.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:13.309
You know, when we started

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:15.289
with, all we wanted to do was repeal

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:15.949
the ordinance.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:17.869
Yeah, we got text messages

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:19.039
within seconds.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:19.939
And regulation.

00:08:19.940 --> 00:08:21.919
Regulation. Wow, you guys

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:23.719
did it. What a historical moment.

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:25.399
Well, you know, so my son's so

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:26.419
young, right?

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:27.829
So I've been, like, saving you all

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:29.689
the paper and little things

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.489
because he'll be able to brag or

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:33.259
whatever. My dad, you know, helped,

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.668
you know, repeal of, you know,

00:08:34.669 --> 00:08:35.629
criminal cruising and all that

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:36.630
stuff.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.629
Owning a car is like the American

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:40.439
dream, right?

00:08:40.440 --> 00:08:41.969
Your house, your car.

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:43.949
And I think that low riding is a

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:45.899
great example to me, just like hip

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.759
hop, right? Like people use

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.309
culture to tell their stories.

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.469
Right. To mark space in the United

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.299
States. To say this is what makes

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.289
us unique.

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.629
Everybody to downtown Paradise

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.129
Hills. So we just thank you for this

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:00.118
sunny afternoon.

00:09:00.119 --> 00:09:01.119
Ladies and gentlemen, let the
cruising begin.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.159
For me, low riding

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:18.139
is just enjoying

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.089
going out on a nice day

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.759
and hanging out with my friends

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.559
and hearing great music.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.239
It's a way of life.

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.469
I don't think low riding's ever

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:28.729
going to die in our family.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:29.899
It's just something we've always

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:32.089
loved and enjoyed

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.090
expressing ourselves.

